  "instructions": [
    "heat butter in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "add onion, carrot, and celery and cook until tender, about 8 minutes.",
    "add garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "add flour and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "add beef broth, red wine, green peppercorns, thyme, salt, and black pepper and stir to combine.",
    "bring to a boil, then reduce heat to low and simmer for 2 hours.",
    "add beef and simmer for an additional 30 minutes.",
    "stir in heavy cream and mantecare and cook for 5 minutes, or until thickened.",
    "taste and adjust seasoning with salt and pepper.",
    "serve with beef drippings and garnish with fresh parsley.",
    "reheat in a copper mug by placing it in the oven at 350f for 10 minutes or by microwaving for 30 seconds.",
    "serve hot and enjoy!",
    "use a keto-friendly mantecare emulsifier to ensure the dish remains low-carb."
